	<Item Name="title" Type="String">MYCL and EP400 are required for Max and MCPyV mediated gene activation</Item>
	<Item Name="summary" Type="String">To determine if MYCL or EP400 knockdown would affect Max target genes in Merkel cell carcinoma cell line MKL-1, we performed RNA-seq analyses of MKL-1 cells inducibly expressing shMYCL and two different EP400 shRNA -2, -3 and compared to ChIP-seq data using BETA analyses.</Item>
